{
  "name": "奥能科技拳套 Arcanotech Gauntlets",
  "type": "weapon",
  "img": "icons/equipment/hand/gauntlet-armored-leather-steel-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>需同调。</em>一对奥能科技驱动的重型拳套，曾属于某位以拳破壁的执法者。本武器为 <strong>+2</strong> 魔法武器，并<strong>视为徒手打击</strong>。</p><p><strong>破甲 Denting Blows（被动）：</strong>你每以本武器命中一个目标，其护甲等级便降低 1（可叠加，最多 3 层，持续 1 分钟）；当叠至第 3 层时，目标立即额外受到 2d8 钝击伤害。冲拳、范围重拳、强袭追击命中亦触发。</p><p><strong>冲拳 Vault Breaker：</strong>（每短休你的熟练加值次）选 20 尺内一个目标，你冲至其身旁。它须作力量豁免（DC 8+你的熟练加值+敏捷调整值），失败则受 2d8 钝击、被击退 10 尺并倒地，成功减半且不被击退。</p><p><strong>范围重拳 Excessive Force：</strong>（每短休你的熟练加值次）一记重拳轰出 15 尺直线。线上每个生物作敏捷豁免，失败受 2d8 钝击并被击退 10 尺，成功减半。</p><p><strong>强袭追击 Assault and Battery：</strong>（每日 1 次）锁定 30 尺内一个目标，势不可挡地冲至其面前并轰下重拳。它须作力量豁免，失败受 6d8 钝击并倒地，成功减半。</p><p><strong>爆能护盾 Blast Shield（被动）：</strong>每当你使用冲拳、范围重拳或强袭追击，你获得 2d6 临时生命值。</p><hr /><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">适用版本：D&amp;D 5e 系统 5.3.3 / Foundry VTT core 13</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>必需依赖</strong>（缺少则招式无法运作）：</p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>Midi QOL<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">midi-qol</code></p></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>libWrapper<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">lib-wrapper</code></p></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>socketlib<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">socketlib</code></p></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>动态主动效应（DAE）<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">dae</code></p></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>效果宏<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">effectmacro</code></p></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>时间限制<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">times-up</code></p></li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>推荐依赖</strong>（用于动画，不装也能正常使用，仅无特效）：</p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>音序器<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">sequencer</code></p></li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><p>JB2A （或免费版 ）<code class=\"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]\">jb2a_patreonJB2A_DnD5e</code></p></li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>安装后请确认：</strong> 在 Midi QOL 设置中开启掷骰自动化（工作流设为完全自动化），否则物品宏不会触发，招式将无响应。</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>使用提示：</strong> 装备并同调本武器后，点击对应招式卡使用——基础拳击、冲拳（冲锋击退）、范围重拳（直线击退）、强袭追击（每日一次的强力突进）。命中会层叠<strong>破甲</strong>（目标 −1 AC，最多 3 层），叠满 3 层时触发一次爆发伤害;被动<strong>爆能护盾</strong>会在出手时提供临时生命值。</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
